<title>ROMANIA: Bucharest bourse prices, turnover on rise.</title>
<headline>Bucharest bourse prices, turnover on rise.</headline>
<text>
<p>1400 GMT - All Bucharest share prices rose at the bourse's first weekly session on Tuesday amid heavy demand.</p>
<p>* Turnover soared to 158.3 million lei from 85.2 million.</p>
<p>* Azomures SA fertiliser maker took some 86 percent of total turnover and saw its price gain 1,700 lei to close at 18,900.</p>
<p>* Two stocks had no trade and syringe maker Sanevit SA remained suspended pending an announcement.</p>
